    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare fertilization, offspring number, and viability in both reciprocal directions for the same species pairs. Large repeatable direction effects support the claim; symmetry across well-powered pairs opposes it.";
